This repository's build scripts produce archives that bundle components from
third-party vendors. This file identifies those components and their
applicable licenses.

================================================================================
INTERNAL USE ONLY
================================================================================
The archives produced by this repository (cuda-trt-*.tar.zst, cuda-trt-*.7z)
are build inputs for internal use only. They must not be redistributed
outside the organization, in whole or in part, as a standalone package.

The NVIDIA licenses below allow only specific runtime files to be
redistributed, only when incorporated into an application that has material
additional functionality, and only unmodified. The compiler (nvcc), most
header files and the import/stub libraries in these archives are not
redistributable. See "Redistributable in a shipped product" under each entry.

