Build-time dependencies — NOT bundled
================================================================================

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CUDA APT packages — Linux build dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cuda-keyring, cuda-cudart-dev, cuda-cudart and cuda-nvcc are NOT bundled as
packages. They are installed at build time and only the files listed above
are extracted. They are subject to the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit EULA.
https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/eula/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7-Zip — Windows build dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7-Zip is NOT bundled in this distribution. It is downloaded at build time
and is subject to the GNU LGPL (with unRAR restriction).
https://www.7-zip.org/

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
winget — Windows build dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
winget is NOT bundled in this distribution. It is used at build time to
install the CUDA Toolkit and 7-Zip, and is subject to the MIT License.
https://github.com/microsoft/winget-cli

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GitHub Actions — CI/CD dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
actions/checkout, aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials and
Cyberboss/install-winget are NOT bundled in this distribution. They are used
in CI/CD pipelines only and are subject to their respective licenses.
